# Which keyboard languages the language key offers, most wanted first.
#
# plasmakeyboardrc ships with enabledLocales empty, and plasma-keyboard reads
# that as "one language only":
#
#     if (PlasmaKeyboardSettings.enabledLocales.length === 0)
#         VirtualKeyboardSettings.activeLocales = [locale];
#
# which leaves the language key greyed out and doing nothing when tapped.
#
# es_MX is the Latin American Spanish layout - Qt ships no es_AR - and it has ñ
# as a real key, which the fallback layout does not: its n only offers ņńnň.
#
# Change this list if you want other languages; the enforcer only steps in when
# the setting is empty, so your own choices are left alone.
en_US,es_MX,es_ES
